# NovaWeather requires ZERO environment variables.
# 100% of the data sources are free and keyless:
#   · Open-Meteo (forecast, air quality, geocoding, astronomy, historical, tiles)
#   · RainViewer (radar)
#   · NASA GIBS (satellite imagery)
#   · OpenFreeMap (vector basemap)
#
# Optional overrides (all have sensible defaults):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_LAT=33.6844
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_LON=73.0479
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_CITY=Islamabad
